{"seq":1,"slug":"software-testing","title":"大学软件工程 — 软件测试","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality/software-testing","wordCount":2157,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学软件工程-软件测试\">大学软件工程 — 软件测试</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>软件测试是通过<strong>执行程序来发现缺陷</strong>的系统化过程。Dijkstra 的经典论断——&quot;测试只能证明缺陷的存在，不能证明缺陷的不存在&quot;——揭示了测试的本质局限性：穷举测试在绝大多数情况下是不可行的。因此，测试的核心挑战是如何用<strong>有限的测试用例</strong>尽可能多地发现缺陷。</p>\n<p>软件测试贯穿整个开发生命周期，按照测试层级可分为单元测试、集成测试、系统测试和验收测试。按照是否关注内部结构可分为<strong>黑盒测试</strong>（基于规格的测试）和<strong>白盒测试</strong>（基于结构的测试）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试层级</th>\n<th>测试对象</th>\n<th>执行者</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>函数、方法、类</td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>验证最小代码单元的正确性</td>\n<td>JUnit, pytest, Jest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>模块间接口</td>\n<td>开发者/测试者</td>\n<td>验证模块协作的正确性</td>\n<td>TestContainers, WireMock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统测试</td>\n<td>完整系统</td>\n<td>测试团队</td>\n<td>验证系统满足需求规格</td>\n<td>Selenium, Cypress</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验收测试</td>\n<td>用户场景</td>\n<td>客户/PO</td>\n<td>验证系统满足业务需求</td>\n<td>Cucumber, Robot Framework</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"黑盒测试技术\">黑盒测试技术</h3><p>黑盒测试将被测系统视为&quot;黑箱&quot;，仅根据输入和预期输出设计测试用例，不关注内部实现。</p>\n<p><strong>等价类划分</strong>（Equivalence Partitioning）将输入域划分为若干等价类，假设同一等价类中的任意值具有等同的测试效果。例如，一个接受年龄输入（有效范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1, 150]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）的函数，可以划分为三个等价类：无效类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-\\infty, 0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、有效类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1, 150]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、无效类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>151</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[151, +\\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">151</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。每个等价类选取一个代表值即可，从无穷多个测试输入缩减为 3 个。</p>\n<p><strong>边界值分析</strong>（Boundary Value Analysis）基于经验观察：缺陷往往集中在输入域的边界附近。对于范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a, b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，边界值测试通常选取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a-1, a, a+1, b-1, b, b+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 六个值。</p>\n<p>假设输入有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个变量，每个变量有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个等价类，则等价类划分需要的最少测试用例数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(n_1, n_2, \\ldots, n_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（单维覆盖）；若要求全组合覆盖，则需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{i=1}^{k} n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2887em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个测试用例，组合爆炸问题随变量数指数增长。<strong>成对测试</strong>（Pairwise Testing）是应对此问题的有效策略，只确保任意两个变量的所有取值组合被覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>决策表法</strong>（Decision Table Testing）适用于有多个条件组合决定不同输出的场景。如果有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个布尔条件，则完整决策表有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 列。通过合并无关条件可以简化决策表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"白盒测试技术\">白盒测试技术</h3><p>白盒测试根据程序的<strong>内部结构</strong>设计测试用例，核心目标是达到特定的代码覆盖率。</p>\n<p><strong>语句覆盖</strong>（Statement Coverage）要求每条可执行语句至少被执行一次。这是最弱的覆盖标准。</p>\n<p><strong>分支覆盖</strong>（Branch Coverage）要求每个条件判断的真假两个分支都至少被执行一次。分支覆盖蕴含语句覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>路径覆盖</strong>（Path Coverage）要求程序中所有可能的执行路径都至少被执行一次。对于包含循环的程序，路径数可能是无穷的。假设程序的控制流图有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 条边和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点，McCabe 的<strong>环形复杂度</strong>可以估算独立路径的数量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(G) = e - n + 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>环形复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 越高，程序越复杂，需要越多的测试用例才能达到充分覆盖。一般建议单个函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(G) \\leq 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>条件覆盖</strong>（Condition Coverage）和 <strong>MC/DC</strong>（Modified Condition/Decision Coverage）是更严格的覆盖标准。MC/DC 要求每个条件都独立地影响决策结果，是航空软件（DO-178C 标准）的强制要求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测试驱动开发-tdd\">测试驱动开发（TDD）</h3><p>TDD 由 Kent Beck 系统化推广，其核心循环为&quot;红-绿-重构&quot;：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>红</strong>（Red）：写一个会失败的测试——明确&quot;下一步要实现什么&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>绿</strong>（Green）：写刚好让测试通过的最少代码——不多不少</li>\n<li><strong>重构</strong>（Refactor）：在测试保护下改善代码结构——消除重复、提高可读性</li>\n</ol>\n<p>TDD 颠覆了&quot;先编码后测试&quot;的传统模式，将测试从<strong>验证活动</strong>转变为<strong>设计活动</strong>。通过先写测试，开发者被迫思考接口设计和使用场景，往往能产出更清晰的 API。</p>\n<p>TDD 的一个常见误解是&quot;100% 覆盖率就意味着高质量&quot;。实际上，覆盖率衡量的是代码被执行的比例，而非断言（Assert）的充分性。一个测试可以执行了所有代码但没有任何断言——覆盖率 100% 但没有发现任何缺陷。<strong>变异测试</strong>（Mutation Testing）通过对源代码引入微小变异（如将 <code>&gt;</code> 改为 <code>&gt;=</code>），检查测试套件是否能&quot;杀死&quot;这些变异体，从而评估测试的<strong>真实检测能力</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能与安全测试\">性能与安全测试</h3><p>功能测试之外，非功能测试同样关键：</p>\n<p><strong>性能测试</strong>的核心指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>响应时间</strong>：从请求发出到收到响应的时间</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐量</strong>：单位时间内处理的请求数（如 TPS/QPS）</li>\n<li><strong>并发用户数</strong>：系统能同时服务的用户数量</li>\n</ul>\n<p>负载测试（Load Testing）验证系统在预期负载下的表现；压力测试（Stress Testing）找出系统的崩溃边界；浸泡测试（Soak Testing）检测长时间运行下的内存泄漏等问题。</p>\n<p><strong>安全测试</strong>关注系统对恶意输入和攻击的抵抗能力。OWASP Top 10 列出了最常见的 Web 安全漏洞（SQL 注入、XSS、CSRF 等），是安全测试的重要参考。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测试金字塔\">测试金字塔</h3><p>Mike Cohn 提出的<strong>测试金字塔</strong>建议测试套件的组成比例：底层大量快速的单元测试，中间适量的集成测试，顶层少量端到端测试。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>反馈精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端到端测试</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>慢（秒~分钟）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>模拟真实场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（毫秒~秒）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>验证组件协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>多</td>\n<td>快（毫秒）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>定位精确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>违反测试金字塔——例如大量依赖 UI 自动化测试——会导致测试套件脆弱、执行缓慢、维护昂贵（被称为&quot;冰淇淋反模式&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某函数接受两个参数：年份（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1900</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1900, 2100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1900</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）和月份（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1, 12]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>），返回该月的天数。使用等价类划分和边界值分析设计测试用例，特别注意闰年的处理。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>计算以下代码片段的环形复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并确定需要多少个测试用例才能达到完整的路径覆盖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"if (a &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; b &gt; 0) {&#10;    result = a + b;&#10;} else if (a &gt; 0) {&#10;    result = a;&#10;} else {&#10;    result = 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if (a > 0 &#x26;&#x26; b > 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = a + b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else if (a > 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p>TDD 的批评者认为，TDD 导致开发者过度关注单元级别的细节，而忽略了系统级别的设计。请评价这一观点，并讨论如何在 TDD 实践中避免&quot;只见树木不见森林&quot;。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>如果一个测试套件的语句覆盖率为 90%，是否意味着它能发现 90% 的缺陷？为什么？请举出一个语句覆盖率 100% 但仍遗漏关键缺陷的具体例子。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Myers, G. et al. (2011). &quot;The Art of Software Testing&quot; (3rd Edition)</strong>：软件测试领域的经典之作，从基本概念到高级技术全覆盖。</li>\n<li><strong>Beck, K. (2002). &quot;Test-Driven Development: By Example&quot;</strong>：TDD 创始人的经典著作，以大量实例展示 TDD 实践。</li>\n<li><strong>Whittaker, J. (2009). &quot;Exploratory Software Testing&quot;</strong>：探索性测试方法的权威指南，适合补充系统化测试方法的不足。</li>\n<li><strong>ISTQB 基础级大纲</strong>（istqb.org）：国际软件测试资质认证的核心教材，体系化且标准化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>软件测试是质量保障体系的核心支柱。从等价类划分和边界值分析等经典黑盒技术，到语句覆盖和 MC/DC 等白盒覆盖标准，再到 TDD 的&quot;测试先行&quot;理念，测试技术在不断演进。测试金字塔为测试策略提供了务实的指导框架。作为自学者，建议从编写单元测试入手，逐步实践 TDD 循环，并在实际项目中探索不同测试层级的组合策略。记住：好的测试不是越多越好，而是在有限的时间和资源约束下，用最巧妙的测试设计发现最多的缺陷。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学软件工程 — 软件测试","id":"大学软件工程-软件测试"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"黑盒测试技术","id":"黑盒测试技术"},{"level":3,"text":"白盒测试技术","id":"白盒测试技术"},{"level":3,"text":"测试驱动开发（TDD）","id":"测试驱动开发-tdd"},{"level":3,"text":"性能与安全测试","id":"性能与安全测试"},{"level":3,"text":"测试金字塔","id":"测试金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学软件工程 — UML 建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-design/uml-modeling"},"next":{"title":"大学软件工程 — 代码审查与重构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality/code-review-refactoring"}}